<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 7.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 4.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   Sept 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   7.44 pct	 7.58</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 8.56 pct	 8.72</p>
<p>    Assigned price  101.30	   101.45</p>
<p>    Total bids	  8.65 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    7.00 trillion lire</p>
<p>The last CCT auction was of a first tranche of Sept 1, 2003 certificates on September 16.</p>
</text>
